   - Enrol a new tenant from `AdmissionsView`.
   - Verify that Admission status is `PENDING`, Room has `reservedCapacity: 1`, and Tenant has `advancePaidStatus: PENDING`.
   - Click "Verify Advance Payment" in the Admissions or Tenants view.
   - Verify that Admission transitions to `PAID`, Tenant transitions to `VERIFIED` (`advancePaidStatus: PAID`), and Room moves slot from `reservedCapacity` to `currentOccupancy`.
